  "description": "Kanject Core realtime over AWS AppSync Events (proposal 0058 P3): UseAppSyncEvents() makes IRealtimePublisher a SigV4-signed POST to the Event API's /event, one call per channel, and AWS fans out. Adapters for the Event API's Lambda authorizer and a namespace's direct-Lambda onSubscribe run the product's IRealtimeAuthorizer and Core's subscription rules. Holds no state. References AWSSDK.Core only.",
